        "original_id": "fb28e1a3-7f07-5528-9aca-f1030e86f126",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nic Cester, Chris Cester, Cameron Muncey\n- Organizations: Jet\n- Products: Cold Hard Bitch, Rollover DJ, Get Born\n\nFacts:\n- Get Born was released on 14 September 2003 as Jet's debut album.\n- Cold Hard Bitch was written by Jet band-members Chris Cester, Nic Cester, and Cameron Muncey.\n- Cold Hard Bitch was released in March 2004.\n- Rollover DJ was released by the Australian rock band Jet as a single from Get Born, and it was the band's second single except in the United States, where it was the third after Cold Hard Bitch.\n- Nic Cester was born on 6 July 1979.\n- Nic Cester is an Australian singer-songwriter and guitarist.\n- Nic Cester is known as the frontman of Jet alongside his younger brother Chris.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
